cott-domain real.posting.client.send_request return: Use http.client.HTTPConnection/HTTPSConnection and follow redirects in a loop with urllib.parse.urljoin; urllib's default opener follows POST redirects and cannot be restricted without defining a class. The scenario HTTP fixture is a real loopback server reached by this same client; cott_runtime._cott_fixture_http returns only a GET body and is not used here.
